  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia Development Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The fund has three primary development objectives: a) improving the enabling environment to increase economic growth; b) allowing increased access to basic services; and c) building government capacity to plan and manage development projects. Poor roadscomma a decaying portcomma non-functional water and sanitation facilitiescomma a lack of agriculture-related infrastructurecomma and non-existent power supplystructures leave Liberia in a poor position to achieve broad-based economic growth and to increase popular access to basic servicescommasuch as health and education. By pooling donor funds to allow financing of large projectscomma this fund will contribute towards improving Liberia&apos;s devastated basic infrastructure (roadscomma portscomma water and sanitation facilitiescomma power supply structurescomma and more)comma thereby promoting economic growth (agriculture-based and otherwise) and facilitating the Government&apos;s efforts to ensure service delivery to the population at large. The fund would also promote capacity developmentcomma both within Government and the private sector. Private sector development would result naturally from the increased opportunities available to contractorscomma while Government&apos;s capacitywould increase as a result of Government participation in project planning and executio
 n.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
